    "intro": [
      "Reasoning is a line for the agent's thinking. It reads \"Thinking\" and opens while the model thinks, then reads \"Thought\" and closes when it is done. The thinking itself sits inside, and the line can show how long it took.",
      "Reasoning is built with Trace with a TraceCollapsible for the thinking."
    ],
    "install": "npx shadcn@latest add trace",
    "usage": "import {\n  Trace,\n  TraceCollapsible,\n  TraceCollapsibleContent,\n  TraceCollapsibleTrigger,\n  TraceIcon,\n  TraceLine,\n  TraceTitle,\n} from \"@/components/ui/trace\"\n\n<Trace>\n  <TraceCollapsible>\n    <TraceCollapsibleTrigger>\n      <TraceLine>\n        <TraceIcon>\n          <CircleCheckIcon />\n        </TraceIcon>\n        <TraceTitle>Thought</TraceTitle>\n      </TraceLine>\n    </TraceCollapsibleTrigger>\n    <TraceCollapsibleContent className=\"whitespace-pre-wrap\">\n      {text}\n    </TraceCollapsibleContent>\n  </TraceCollapsible>\n</Trace>",
    "sdk": {
      "text": "Render each reasoning part as a line. It starts as a plain TraceLine and becomes a TraceCollapsible once text arrives, so there is nothing to open before the model has written anything. It opens while the model thinks and closes when it finishes. If the person opens or closes it, their choice wins. See Open State.",
      "code": "function ReasoningLine({ text, running }: { text: string; running: boolean }) {\n  const [open, setOpen] = React.useState<boolean>()\n\n  const line = (\n    <TraceLine status={running ? \"running\" : undefined}>\n      <TraceIcon>\n        {running ? (\n          <LoaderCircleIcon className=\"animate-spin\" />\n        ) : (\n          <CircleCheckIcon />\n        )}\n      </TraceIcon>\n      <TraceTitle>{running ? \"Thinking\" : \"Thought\"}</TraceTitle>\n    </TraceLine>\n  )\n\n  if (text.length === 0) {\n    return line\n  }\n\n  return (\n    <TraceCollapsible open={open ?? running} onOpenChange={setOpen}>\n      <TraceCollapsibleTrigger>{line}</TraceCollapsibleTrigger>\n      <TraceCollapsibleContent className=\"whitespace-pre-wrap\">\n        {text}\n      </TraceCollapsibleContent>\n    </TraceCollapsible>\n  )\n}\n\n<Trace>\n  {message.parts\n    .filter((part) => part.type === \"reasoning\")\n    .map((part, index) => (\n      <ReasoningLine\n        key={index}\n        text={part.text}\n        running={streaming && part.state === \"streaming\"}\n      />\n    ))}\n</Trace>"
    },
